- moveObject (default dsaOp=move): Drag an object onto a slot or position to relocate it without destroying order guarantees.
- comparePair (default dsaOp=compare): Select two objects and declare lt / eq / gt between their values.
- swapPair (default dsaOp=swap): Exchange the positions of two objects.
- pushPop (default dsaOp=push): Push an object into or pop an object from a stack/queue container.
- choosePath (default dsaOp=choose-path): Pick one branch (e.g. left / right) to narrow the remaining search space.
- traverseNode (default dsaOp=traverse): Advance a cursor from one node to the next linked node.
- connectNodes (default dsaOp=link): Draw or rewire a next/prev pointer between two nodes.
- assignValue (default dsaOp=assign): Set a value into a slot, container or variable (e.g. running max, complement, sum).
- submitAnswer (default dsaOp=terminate): Commit the final answer: declare the result index, value, or outcome.

